From 487c2a27962f084185f60f050171d40bc0024d0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 20:50:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tighten prose: cut canceler-speak, redundancy, awkward
 constructions
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pass through the player-facing text (looks, lore, dialogues, use-actions)
following Nora Gal and Ilyahov: remove nominalizations where a verb works
("библиотека содержит" → "в библиотеке"; "встреча состоится" → "встреча —"),
break stacked participles into short sentences, kill filler ("уже", "просто")
and repeat-statements, fix a few grammatically-off mirror constructions ("ту,
где ты не зашёл сюда" → "ту, в которой ты сюда не зашёл").

Preserves the telegraphic, atmospheric voice — surgical edits only.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01LVwPreRodjCmwpCk6uZGEa
